          "start": 272.02,
          "end": 272.71,
          "en": "Up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 272.71,
          "end": 274.21,
          "en": "So let's quickly do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 274.57,
          "end": 279.97,
          "en": "Let's add a helper function for that which you could even store in a helper file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 279.97,
          "end": 282.43,
          "en": "So let me add a new file validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 282.43,
          "end": 285.01,
          "en": "JS There I export a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 285.01,
          "end": 286.96,
          "en": "Now this is not a svelte file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 286.96,
          "end": 288.76,
          "en": "This is a normal JavaScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 289.42,
          "end": 292.24,
          "en": "And I'll name the function is valid email.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 292.51,
          "end": 296.68,
          "en": "I receive a value there and I return the result of the check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 296.68,
          "end": 303.58,
          "en": "If value includes an add sign and now in app svelte we can simply import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 305.21,
          "end": 314.54,
          "en": "From validation and want to import the is valid email function we just created and then we can call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 314.54,
          "end": 315.02,
          "en": "it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 315.71,
          "end": 321.11,
          "en": "Here and simply pass in the entered email and we can also execute that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
